{
  "doc": "M3-C08-02 greybox: ch08/corrow (act1_ch08.md B01-B02, B04 gate, B08-B18). North is -z; the sea is south (+z). The trader comes in from the south to the harbour mole (Mole), which climbs through a gap in the seawall onto the wall-head walk (z 26..36) among the Watchers (a row of carved faces on the parapet, z 38). The Fisher Stair runs from the wall-head (StairHead, x 0) down into the low town under the wall's lee (z -10..-60): lanes, Marra's doorstep, the net racks, the stair foot. The Bastion's upper town is west (barracks, chapel, the save shrine, the chandler); the watch-red wall-gate to the headland and Coilspire is at the wall-head's east end (WallGate). A strip of shingle runs along the outer foot of the wall (Kerrid's exit). Everything is flat for the controller; the stair and the wall-head are painted slabs, the parapet and the sea are solid. The seaward wall section by the stair (WallSection, its Watchers, its paler 1001 blocks) is the one the Breach takes. states (Ch04Zone): the day's cast; the storm from ch08_beacon_opened (the kites down, the watch and the crowd on the stair, the shield-line); the hoist from ch08_hoist_rigged; Pell on the outer parapet from ch08_wave2_held; the flood and Kerrid at the stair foot from ch08_wave3_held; the figure in the storm from ch08_reach_survived; the breach, the black lake and the aftermath cast from ch08_wall_fell; the cut rope from ch08_hoist_cut_down. lights (Ch06Zone): the storm (ch08_storm) and the aftermath (ch08_aftermath). start_hidden (Ch08Zone): the flood, the lake, the breach and the hoist. The set piece's four fights return to WallHead. Env-art's Corrow kit (act1_ch08.md §9 Environment Art 1-2) replaces the blocks.",
